  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 pound boneless pork loin, coarsely chopped",
    "2 ounces peeled shrimp, finely chopped",
    "1 tablespoon Chinese rice wine",
    "1 tablespoon light soy sauce",
    "1 teaspoon brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon finely chopped green onions",
    "1 teaspoon chopped fresh ginger root",
    "24 (3.5 inch square) wonton wrappers",
    "3 cups chicken stock",
    "2 tablespoons finely chopped green onions"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W_BklmpuMGX-tkR0z9mvmurV7lY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13199-wonton-soup-VAT-step-01-50a4879bf090450499f3ff73b938bc78.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13199/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the wontons: Mix pork, shrimp, rice wine, soy sauce, brown sugar, green onions, and ginger together in a large bowl until well combined. Let stand for 25 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mXF0_V9g89giXBrmbRAGE2XEubM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13199-wonton-soup-VAT-step-02-d15c4cc8b0994bc5ae72550f15bad06f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13199/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon about 1 teaspoon filling onto the center of a wonton wrapper. Moisten all four wrapper edges with water and fold over filling to make a triangle; press the edges firmly to seal.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AMVlQyY3sNGeOJyejouPMqQj-y4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13199-wonton-soup-VAT-step-03-9e1f07c59c964ccea811022baea67796.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13199/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring left and right corners together above filling; overlap the tips of these corners, moisten with water, and press together to seal. Repeat until all wrappers have been filled and sealed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IFFK4qlsWEdvtyJjHfALPgUi6FQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13199-wonton-soup-VAT-step-04-cde0ea3cc076421a9931d984ba21aeab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13199/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the soup: Bring chicken stock to a rolling boil in a pot. Gently drop in wontons and cook for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-ltovunH-GjNm4j44FGiHzERzjY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13199-wonton-soup-VAT-step-05-187bc815a6064b9d961827050f57d361.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13199/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle into bowls and garnish with green onions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sh9xwbK6j087H0ALABnohViKO94=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13199-wonton-soup-VAT-step-06-2706dc5ce15f43e5a27bfe312cf90831.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13199/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oiO3k3uir05bhdLXCDh9lnEob8Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-13199-wonton-soup-VAT-4x3-31bd1ef2795144ee93fed67a1cf3743d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13199/step_07.webp"
    }
